{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CDTVライブ！ライブ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Lonesome rabbit」\nフルサイズ初披露させていただきました🐇"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobwGDfgb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobYZvBKN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNSTk2n.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobviWJtu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobZccTR7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobLZ9I8G.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobuyjHy8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご覧いただけたでしょうか…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手振りが、、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "は、はやい、、、！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこまでもぶんぶん高速で回せるようになりたいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか櫻坂飛んでるかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にムキムキになりましょう💪🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと来週6月8日(月)CDTVライブ！ライブ！で\n「What’s \"KAZOKU\"?」\nを披露させていただきます‪＾‬ ‪＾‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二週連続なんて、、嬉しい！！！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます🙇🏻‍♀️🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しい櫻坂の色をみていただけると思うので\nとてもとても楽しみです！！！！‪(  ᷇࿀ ᷆  )‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月6日(土)\nNHK「Venue101」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出演させていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧下さい💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob2zGZ3w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjnrYW6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobEAdd4d.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobmlzfnV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "音楽番組に出演させていただける度に、\nだいすきな櫻坂46が\nひとりでも多くの方の目に留まるようにと、\nそんな気持ちで臨ませていただいています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46のライブに足を運んでいただけるきっかけになれるように、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてメンバーひとりひとりの魅力を知っていただける、興味を持っていただけるきっかけになれるように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "責任感をもち\n今作も活動していきます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバー同士も切磋琢磨し支え合いながら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "強く逞しい\nBuddiesが誇れるような櫻坂46でありたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15枚目シングル、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごいすごい数字だ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい、本当に嬉しいです！！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんっとうに、ありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大感謝です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46がだいすきです！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張ります！よろしくお願いいたします☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日はかわいいかわいい\n四期生ちゃん達の大切な日！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひたむきなみんなが、本当にかっこよくて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応援しています！頑張ってね🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日6月4日19時頃から\nVOCE公式インスタグラムにて\nインスタライブを行います！🤳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://i-voce.jp/feed/4914124/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お時間合う方は是非！！\nお待ちしています‪＾‬ ‪＾‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほなね！\n櫻坂46 田村保乃"}], "source": "official"}